WEBVTT

00:00:10.990 --> 00:00:12.400
Master...

00:00:15.110 --> 00:00:17.620
Oh, wow! Today's my lucky day!

00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:19.820
I've seen a lot of elves.

00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:21.730
And I think you're my favorite!

00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:23.610
Lovely, just lovely!

00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:27.530
Hey, you! Be my slave!

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:34.350
What was that for, Mr. Nobody?

00:00:34.350 --> 00:00:37.430
You tried to charm Efil, didn't you?

00:00:37.430 --> 00:00:38.950
What if I did?

00:00:38.950 --> 00:00:43.660
Do you think somebody like you
can stand up to me, Clive,

00:00:43.660 --> 00:00:46.090
the general of the Trycen Magic Knights?

00:00:46.320 --> 00:00:48.520
Let me make one thing clear!

00:00:48.990 --> 00:00:51.670
You'd better not try to
lay a hand on my woman!

00:01:00.330 --> 00:01:03.210
Black Summoner

00:02:22.480 --> 00:02:25.210
You'd better not try to
lay a hand on my woman!

00:02:25.660 --> 00:02:30.780
Oh man, that's a cheesy line.

00:02:30.780 --> 00:02:33.480
I've never seen anybody say it in real life.

00:02:33.480 --> 00:02:35.350
Aren't you embarrassed?

00:02:38.090 --> 00:02:42.890
Name: Clive
Level: 91 Title: Magic Knights Army General
HP 847/847
MP 2050/2400
Age: 18 | Strength 234
Sex: Male | Endurance 263
Race: Human | Agility 355
Class: Green Mage | Magic 802
Luck 488
Skills:
Charming Eyes (Unique Skill) | Green Magic (S)
Appraising Eye (A) | Detect Magic (A) | Concealment (A)
Fearless (B) | Stamina (S) | Persuasion (B) | Preserving (B)
Double Growth Rate | Double Skill Points

00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:42.180
The way your status is centered
around your Unique Skill...

00:02:43.310 --> 00:02:45.380
Are you reincarnated?

00:02:45.990 --> 00:02:48.200
Well, aren't you the Peeping Tom?

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:50.340
My Concealment is A Rank.

00:02:50.340 --> 00:02:53.360
But you've got an Appraising
Eye that can see through it.

00:02:53.720 --> 00:02:56.820
So maybe you're reincarnated, too?

00:02:57.080 --> 00:02:59.770
Efil, get inside the walls.

00:02:59.770 --> 00:03:01.250
I'm taking the watchtower apart.

00:03:01.720 --> 00:03:03.730
Okay, Master!

00:03:03.730 --> 00:03:04.890
Good luck!

00:03:07.790 --> 00:03:09.310
Stealth?

00:03:09.310 --> 00:03:11.020
You said your name's Efil, right?

00:03:11.020 --> 00:03:12.720
Don't go!

00:03:12.720 --> 00:03:14.630
Shut your mouth!

00:03:26.140 --> 00:03:28.790
Forming four Obsidian Edges...

00:03:29.630 --> 00:03:30.430
Complete!

00:03:31.330 --> 00:03:32.550
There!

00:03:35.590 --> 00:03:37.680
That bastard...

00:03:44.980 --> 00:03:47.470
Okay, you scared me a little!

00:03:47.470 --> 00:03:51.410
But I'm the main character
and you're just a nobody!

00:03:51.650 --> 00:03:56.620
How long did you spend making that
character, Mr. Hottie Main Character?

00:04:07.770 --> 00:04:08.890
Fly!

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:12.410
You're wasting your time!

00:04:12.410 --> 00:04:17.350
Nothing can pass through my Helix Barrier,
whether it's magical or physical!

00:04:17.620 --> 00:04:21.190
Normally, anything that
touches it is destroyed...

00:04:21.490 --> 00:04:25.270
I guess your swords are pretty tough, huh?

00:04:29.090 --> 00:04:31.860
He is strong!

00:04:33.590 --> 00:04:36.310
What are you laughing at, creep?

00:04:36.310 --> 00:04:39.040
Shouldn't you be watching your back?

00:04:48.710 --> 00:04:50.900
Don't tell me they're...

00:04:52.580 --> 00:04:54.990
You charmed your whole party?

00:04:54.990 --> 00:04:56.870
Some hero you are!

00:04:56.870 --> 00:04:58.060
Non, non.

00:04:58.060 --> 00:05:03.290
They're all happy to serve a
super-handsome master like me!

00:05:03.290 --> 00:05:05.590
Look, it's five vs one!

00:05:05.590 --> 00:05:07.360
You're outnumbered!

00:05:07.980 --> 00:05:10.820
Don't worry. That's not really the case.

00:05:10.820 --> 00:05:13.890
Stop talking and die, already.

00:05:13.890 --> 00:05:16.380
I need to crush you and go get Efil...

00:05:17.630 --> 00:05:19.120
A penetration attack?

00:05:19.660 --> 00:05:21.420
My Helix Barrier...?

00:05:29.770 --> 00:05:32.530
So, what's this about me being outnumbered?

00:05:35.480 --> 00:05:38.080
Are those really golems?

00:05:38.080 --> 00:05:41.610
Yup. I modified Adamantine Golems,

00:05:41.610 --> 00:05:46.730
giving them souls so they can not only
act autonomously but use skills, as well.

00:05:48.630 --> 00:05:52.290
Black magic? Clever.

00:05:52.290 --> 00:05:56.930
Kitties, go play with the big guys.

00:05:58.010 --> 00:06:01.040
Listen, don't kill them.

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:02.340
I'll break the charm later.

00:06:02.810 --> 00:06:03.710
Go!

00:06:09.560 --> 00:06:12.000
Now it's one-on-one.

00:06:15.020 --> 00:06:18.300
Fine, I'll play with you.

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:30.600
Not bad! You can keep up with me, huh?

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:35.970
Now, let's see who's faster!

00:06:39.870 --> 00:06:42.220
I don't even need my Helix Barrier—

00:06:49.600 --> 00:06:50.180
Go!

00:06:50.180 --> 00:06:52.500
Not bad, Mr. Nobody!

00:06:52.500 --> 00:06:55.560
If you want to be my servant,
I'm fine with that!

00:06:57.080 --> 00:06:59.470
Shut your mouth!

00:07:05.070 --> 00:07:06.770
Not a chance in Hell.

00:07:07.290 --> 00:07:08.730
Too bad.

00:07:08.950 --> 00:07:10.810
Then, die.

00:07:13.850 --> 00:07:14.750
Not bad.

00:07:24.370 --> 00:07:26.680
Hey, you're hitting your own party!

00:07:27.630 --> 00:07:29.030
Who cares?

00:07:29.030 --> 00:07:31.670
I've got plenty of spares!

00:07:33.690 --> 00:07:35.260
You...

00:07:38.550 --> 00:07:41.000
You're done running away?

00:07:46.750 --> 00:07:47.970
I see...

00:07:47.970 --> 00:07:51.170
You're the type who gets bugged by that.

00:07:51.170 --> 00:07:55.160
But who cares about the
people in this world?

00:07:56.320 --> 00:07:59.720
A world of freedom,
with no restrictive rules!

00:07:59.720 --> 00:08:01.950
Power to do whatever you want!

00:08:01.950 --> 00:08:06.760
The power I got when I reincarnated is a
cheat that lets me do whatever I want!

00:08:07.240 --> 00:08:11.470
You couldn't have this much
fun in your old world, right?

00:08:16.020 --> 00:08:20.630
You were enjoying your
power, too, weren't you?

00:08:20.630 --> 00:08:24.470
The look on your face tells me you were
having the time of your life fighting just now,

00:08:24.470 --> 00:08:26.690
Mr. Battle Junkie.

00:08:28.880 --> 00:08:34.340
Yeah. Strong power makes me
feel fulfilled—excited.

00:08:39.360 --> 00:08:40.590
But...

00:08:40.590 --> 00:08:43.460
If you only care about yourself
and not the people around you,

00:08:43.460 --> 00:08:46.110
you're pathetic, and ugly, and nothing else!

00:08:47.150 --> 00:08:48.840
I don't like you.

00:08:48.840 --> 00:08:51.590
I don't like you, either!

00:08:51.860 --> 00:08:54.090
Helix Barrier!

00:08:55.040 --> 00:08:56.760
Vortex Edge!

00:09:17.070 --> 00:09:20.060
You scarred... my face!

00:09:20.420 --> 00:09:22.090
You couldn't handle it, huh?

00:09:22.450 --> 00:09:23.880
Thanks for everything.

00:09:24.210 --> 00:09:25.070
Clotho.

00:09:25.980 --> 00:09:26.890
Do it.

00:09:29.870 --> 00:09:33.540
You'll pay for that! You'll pay!

00:09:33.800 --> 00:09:37.250
Did that teach you a little about pain?

00:09:37.250 --> 00:09:40.220
Shut up! I'll destroy you!

00:09:40.220 --> 00:09:43.380
Behold my true power!

00:09:43.380 --> 00:09:46.100
My ultimate Rank S magic!

00:09:46.100 --> 00:09:48.550
Yeah, let's see what you've got.

00:09:52.090 --> 00:09:56.090
Don't underestimate me!

00:10:03.160 --> 00:10:06.800
Rank S magic is the most powerful
magic a mage can have.

00:10:07.230 --> 00:10:09.950
Its power is akin to that
of a natural disaster!

00:10:09.950 --> 00:10:12.310
Nobody can stop me now!

00:10:15.760 --> 00:10:19.970
This is my Tempest Barrier!

00:10:24.350 --> 00:10:26.600
I guess this is pretty bad.

00:10:26.960 --> 00:10:29.030
Clotho, bring it out.

00:10:34.780 --> 00:10:36.500
Thank you, Clotho.

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:41.240
Blackstaff Disaster (Rank S)

00:10:36.500 --> 00:10:37.750
Now go hide.

00:10:38.730 --> 00:10:41.230
Let's see what you can do,
Blackstaff Disaster!

00:10:42.930 --> 00:10:44.840
You can't run away.

00:10:44.840 --> 00:10:46.080
I won't let you.

00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:55.290
I didn't want to hurt a forest
that was connected to Efil...

00:10:56.410 --> 00:10:58.120
That's not good.

00:10:58.920 --> 00:11:00.400
Master...

00:11:01.360 --> 00:11:04.310
I believe in you, My King.

00:11:05.410 --> 00:11:07.550
Is Brother Kel okay?

00:11:08.220 --> 00:11:14.740
My Lord, I can just imagine
the look on your face...

00:11:16.440 --> 00:11:19.690
It's still incomplete,
and I've never tried it before...

00:11:20.220 --> 00:11:21.790
but here goes nothing!

00:11:22.090 --> 00:11:23.870
Boreas Deathscythe!

00:11:23.870 --> 00:11:28.210
Who cares? Die!

00:11:28.210 --> 00:11:30.820
That's exactly what I'm telling you!

00:11:46.010 --> 00:11:51.010
